						],
						"pointId": 8541
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							-1356.708,
							133.599,
							9758.088
						],
						"pointId": 8542
					},
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							-1354.731,
							133.501,
							9760.959
						],
						"pointId": 8682
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750700701,
					"content": "Haha! I knew we'd meet again! Your timing is impeccable, too — you are about to witness my second masterpiece!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750700702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Magnifico"
				},
				{
					"id": 750700702,
					"content": "Hmm... Maybe not the second. I do have a ton of fine works, don't I...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750700703
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Magnifico"
				},
				{
					"id": 750700703,
					"content": "Either way, you're most fortunate, for you shall witness me attempt dynamic photography for the first time!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750700704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Magnifico"
				},
				{
					"id": 750700704,
					"content": "After all, the photos I used to take were all those of victims at crime scenes... Uh, never mind. That does not bear going into detail about...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750700705
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Magnifico"
				},
				{
					"id": 750700705,
					"content": "So, do you need our help again this time, Mr. Magnifico?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750700706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750700706,
					"content": "Rawr?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750700707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750700707,
					"content": "No, no, certainly n... Hmm, on second thoughts, that would be marvelous! Come, let me explain the situation to you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750700708
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Magnifico"
				},
				{
					"id": 750700708,
					"content": "So, here's the situation. I need to take photos of a Qucusaurus diving toward the water's surface at this waterfall. We want to catch that most impactful of frames, just as it plunges right down to the surface!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750700709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Magnifico"
				},
				{
					"id": 750700709,
					"content": "I've hidden food that can attract Qucusaurs in the pond beneath the waterfall. It's just that... *sigh* Well, they haven't come down at the right angle yet.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750700710
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Magnifico"
				},
				{
					"id": 750700710,
					"content": "Hmm? Hang on. What's that big circle there on the water's surface?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750700711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750700711,
					"content": "I wouldn't worry too much about it, though I'm not too sure what it is... It's just some junk I picked up from a nearby tribe to use as a target.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750700712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Magnifico"
				},
				{
					"id": 750700712,
					"content": "*sigh* All the scrap photos I've taken so far are utterly mundane, so much so that it's annoying. I could keep waiting, but since you're here...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750700713
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Magnifico"
				},
				{
					"id": 750700713,
					"content": "Perhaps you could... uh, guide them? Teach them how to perform a most lovely dive? I mean, you are a Saurian tamer famed throughout Natlan, are you not?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750700714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Magnifico"
				},
				{
					"id": 750700714,
					"content": "Alright? Great! I'll send a signal out from here. So long as you can get to the precise location of the target by the water when I count down to \"one,\" we're all set!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750700715,
						750700717
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Magnifico"
				},
				{
					"id": 750700715,
					"content": "We can give it a go.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750700716
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750700716,
					"content": "Haha, excellent! Let's give it a try, then!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Magnifico"
				},
				{
					"id": 750700717,
					"content": "We can't guarantee success...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750700718
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750700718,
					"content": "That's fine. If we fail, all we've lost is time. And we're travelers — no one's time is worth less than ours.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750700719
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750700719,
					"content": "?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				}
			]
		},
